   "html": "<figure><img src=\"symp/img/yb-3-9-f1.webp\" alt=\"Abdominal swelling mnemonic 6F\"><figcaption>3.9 Abdominal swelling — Mnemonic 6F</figcaption></figure><div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y39a\"></div><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>6F</th><th>สาเหตุ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fat</td><td>Obesity</td></tr><tr><td>Flatus (Air)</td><td>Ileus, Gut obstruction</td></tr><tr><td>Feces</td><td>Constipation, Gut obstruction</td></tr><tr><td>Fluid (Ascites)</td><td>ดู Common etiology ด้านล่าง และหัวข้อ Ascites</td></tr><tr><td>Fatal growth (Abd. Mass)</td><td>Hepatomegaly, Splenomegaly, Malignancies, AAA, Full bladder, Cyst/abscess</td></tr><tr><td>Fetus</td><td>Pregnancy</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\">Common etiology ของ Fluid (Ascites)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cirrhosis</td><td>85 %</td></tr><tr><td>Other PHT related-disorder</td><td>8 %</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiac disease</td><td>3 %</td></tr><tr><td>Peritoneal Carcinomatosis</td><td>3 %</td></tr><tr><td>other nonPHT-related disorder</td><td>2 %</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "yb-3-9-ascites",
   "h": "3.10 Ascites — แยกตาม SAAG",
   "html": "<figure><img src=\"symp/img/yb-3-9-f2.webp\" alt=\"Algorithm Ascites portal vs non-portal hypertension\"><figcaption>3.10 Ascites (มีลายมือขีดม่วงแก้ SAAG ≥ เป็น &lt; ที่ Non-Portal Hypertension)</figcaption></figure><div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y39b\"></div><div class=\"box\"><b>PE</b>: Abd distension, Dullness on percussion · Moderate ascites: Shifting dullness +ve · Massive ascites: Fluid Thrill +ve</div><p><span class=\"hw\">Non-Portal Hypertension: SAAG < 1.1 g/dl (ลายมือขีดแก้เครื่องหมาย ≥ เป็น <)</span></p>",
   "sub": [
    {
     "id": "yb-3-9-saag",
     "h": "SAAG (หน้าแทรกจากตำราอื่น)",
     "html": "<p><small>(หน้าแทรกจากตำราอื่นในเล่มเหลือง)</small></p><figure><img src=\"symp/img/yb-3-9-f3.webp\" alt=\"แผนภูมิ SAAG ภาพแทรก\"><figcaption>แผนภูมิ SAAG (ภาพแทรก)</figcaption></figure><div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y39c\"></div><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>SAAG</th><th>Ascitic protein</th><th>สาเหตุ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">≥ 1.1 g/dL</td><td>&lt; 2.5 g/dL</td><td>Cirrhosis · Late Budd-Chiari syndrome · Massive liver metastases</td></tr><tr><td>≥ 2.5 g/dL</td><td>Congestive heart failure/constrictive pericarditis · Early Budd-Chiari syndrome · IVC obstruction · Sinusoidal obstruction syndrome</td></tr><tr><td>&lt; 1.1 g/dL</td><td>—</td><td>Biliary leak · Nephrotic syndrome · Pancreatitis · Peritoneal carcinomatosis · Tuberculosis</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    }
   ]
  }
